  m_text: 'Throughout the game, there are certain moments were Hamlet will do some
    actions that will help the story progress that we would like him to act them
    out. A lot of these actions are tied to cinematics, but there are also many that
    will be experienced during gameplay in response to other things happening. Below
    you''ll find some ideas:'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: fe129390af88b40faa85c89db6820ea6, type: 2}
